    {
      "id": "ch-stampede",
      "choreo": "chapter",
      "chapter": "Why does it collapse?",
      "beats": [
        {
          "pace": "normal",
          "style": "serious",
          "say": "So why does it collapse? [pause 0.3] This is the part nobody plans for."
        }
      ],
      "scene": {
        "type": "chapter",
        "number": 2,
        "title": "Why does it collapse?",
        "subtitle": "When one key expires for everyone",
        "line": "red",
        "short": "The stampede"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "stampede",
      "choreo": "failure",
      "beats": [
        {
          "say": "Picture one {hot key|c-hot}: the home feed, read thousands of times a second."
        },
        {
          "pace": "slow",
          "say": "At nine p.m., its TTL {runs out|c-expire}. [pause 0.4]"
        },
        {
          "pace": "brisk",
          "say": "Every request in the next few milliseconds {misses|c-miss}, and every one of them goes {straight to the database|c-flood}."
        },
        {
          "pace": "slow",
          "say": "Same row. Same query. A thousand times over. [pause 0.3] The database {falls over|c-dead}."
        }
      ],
      "scene": {
        "type": "diagram",
        "diagram": "cache",
        "actions": [
          {
            "at": "start",
            "do": "clear-lines"
          },
          {
            "at": "c-hot",
            "do": "badge",
            "target": "cache",
            "text": "feed:home",
            "line": "yellow"
          },
          {
            "at": "c-hot+0.4",
            "do": "flow",
            "path": [
              "users",
              "api",
              "cache"
            ],
            "line": "read",
            "stream": true
          },
          {
            "at": "c-expire",
            "do": "badge",
            "target": "cache",
            "text": "EXPIRED",
            "line": "red"
          },
          {
            "at": "c-miss",
            "do": "pulse",
            "targets": [
              "cache"
            ],
            "line": "red"
          },
          {
            "at": "c-flood",
            "do": "flow",
            "path": [
              "api",
              "db"
            ],
            "line": "herd",
            "stream": true,
            "speed": 1.6
          },
          {
            "at": "c-flood+1.2",
            "do": "badge",
            "target": "db",
            "text": "×1000",
            "line": "red"
          },
          {
            "at": "c-dead",
            "do": "fail",
            "targets": [
              "db"
            ]
          },
          {
            "at": "c-dead+0.3",
            "do": "badge",
            "target": "db",
            "text": "TIMEOUT",
            "line": "red"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "slow-motion",
      "choreo": "deep-dive",
      "beats": [
        {
          "say": "Slow it down. {Request A|c-a} misses, and asks the database."
        },
        {
          "say": "While A waits, {everyone else|c-b} misses too."
        },
        {
          "say": "And they all {ask the database|c-db} for the very same row. [pause 0.3] Nobody knows someone is already fetching it."
        }
      ],
      "scene": {
        "type": "sequence",
        "title": "Thousands of misses, one row",
        "actors": [
          {
            "id": "a",
            "label": "Request A",
            "kind": "client"
          },
          {
            "id": "rest",
            "label": "Everyone else",
            "kind": "users"
          },
          {
            "id": "cache",
            "label": "Cache",
            "kind": "cache"
          },
          {
            "id": "db",
            "label": "Database",
            "kind": "db"
          }
        ],
        "messages": [
          {
            "from": "a",
            "to": "cache",
            "label": "GET feed:home",
            "code": true,
            "at": "c-a"
          },
          {
            "from": "cache",
            "to": "a",
            "label": "miss",
            "style": "dashed",
            "line": "orange",
            "at": "c-a+0.6"
          },
          {
            "from": "a",
            "to": "db",
            "label": "SELECT feed",
            "code": true,
            "line": "orange",
            "at": "c-a+1.2"
          },
          {
            "from": "rest",
            "to": "cache",
            "label": "GET feed:home",
            "code": true,
            "at": "c-b"
          },
          {
            "from": "cache",
            "to": "rest",
            "label": "miss",
            "style": "dashed",
            "line": "orange",
            "at": "c-b+0.6"
          },
          {
            "from": "rest",
            "to": "db",
            "label": "SELECT feed",
            "code": true,
            "line": "red",
            "at": "c-db",
            "badge": {
              "text": "×999",
              "line": "red"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "insight",
      "choreo": "insight",
      "beats": [
        {
          "say": "Nothing in the cache was broken. [pause 0.5] It simply expired, {for everyone, at the same moment|c-all}.",
          "pace": "slow"
        }
      ],
      "scene": {
        "type": "statement",
        "lines": [
          "The cache didn't break.",
          "It expired for {everyone|red}."
        ],
        "reveal": [
          "start",
          "c-all"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ch-fixes",
      "choreo": "chapter",
      "chapter": "How do we stop it?",
      "beats": [
        {
          "pace": "brisk",
          "style": "excited",
          "say": "So how do we stop it? [pause 0.2] Three fixes, and they work best together."
        }
      ],
      "scene": {
        "type": "chapter",
        "number": 3,
        "title": "How do we stop it?",
        "subtitle": "Coalesce, serve stale, add jitter",
        "line": "green",
        "short": "Three fixes"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesce",
      "choreo": "solution",
      "beats": [
        {
          "say": "Fix one: {coalesce|c-co} the misses.",
          "pace": "brisk"
        },
        {
          "say": "The first request that misses does the {database read|c-load}. Everyone else {waits for that one result|c-wait}. [pause 0.3]"
        },
        {
          "say": "In Go, that's the {singleflight|c-sf} package. Facebook's memcache paper describes the same idea, using {leases|c-lease}.",
          "style": "neutral"
        }
      ],
      "scene": {
        "type": "code",
        "title": "feed.go",
        "lines": [
          "var feeds singleflight.Group",
          "",
          "func Feed(key string) (any, error) {",
          "  v, err, _ := feeds.Do(key, func() (any, error) {",
          "    return db.LoadFeed(key) // once per key",
          "  })",
          "  return v, err",
          "}"
        ],
        "actions": [
          {
            "at": "c-load",
            "do": "highlight",
            "lines": [
              5,
              5
            ],
            "line": "green"
          },
          {
            "at": "c-wait",
            "do": "highlight",
            "lines": [
              4,
              4
            ],
            "line": "blue"
          },
          {
            "at": "c-sf",
            "do": "highlight",
            "lines": [
              1,
              1
            ],
            "line": "violet"
          }
        ],
        "heading": "Fix 1: {coalesce|green} the misses"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced",
      "choreo": "solution",
      "beats": [
        {
          "say": "Now the stampede becomes {one query|c-one}. [pause 0.3] The database {recovers|c-rec}, and the cache is {refilled|c-fill}, once."
        }
      ],
      "scene": {
        "type": "diagram",
        "diagram": "cache",
        "actions": [
          {
            "at": "start",
            "do": "clear-lines"
          },
          {
            "at": "start+0.2",
            "do": "flow",
            "path": [
              "users",
              "api"
            ],
            "line": "read",
            "stream": true
          },
          {
            "at": "c-one",
            "do": "badge",
            "target": "api",
            "text": "1 IN FLIGHT",
            "line": "green"
          },
          {
            "at": "c-one",
            "do": "flow",
            "path": [
              "api",
              "db"
            ],
            "line": "fix"
          },
          {
            "at": "c-rec",
            "do": "recover",
            "targets": [
              "db"
            ]
          },
          {
            "at": "c-fill",
            "do": "flow",
            "path": [
              "api",
              "cache"
            ],
            "line": "fill"
          },
          {
            "at": "c-fill+0.8",
            "do": "badge",
            "target": "cache",
            "text": "HIT",
            "line": "green"
          }
        ],
        "heading": "One miss, {one query|green}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "stale-jitter",
      "choreo": "solution",
      "beats": [
        {
          "say": "Fix two: {serve stale|c-stale}. When a hot key expires, keep answering with the old value for a few seconds, while {one request|c-one} refreshes it."
        },
        {
          "say": "Users get data that's a little old, [pause 0.2] {instead of an error|c-err}."
        },
        {
          "say": "Fix three: {add jitter|c-jit}. Instead of every key living exactly sixty seconds, give each one sixty, {plus or minus a little|c-pm}."
        },
        {
          "say": "Keys stop expiring in lockstep. [pause 0.2] It won't save a single hot key, but it {stops thousands of keys|c-many} expiring together."
        }
      ],
      "scene": {
        "type": "compare",
        "left": {
          "title": "Fix 2: serve stale",
          "line": "yellow",
          "at": "start",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Instant answer, old value",
              "verdict": "pro",
              "at": "c-stale+1.5"
            },
            {
              "text": "One background refresh",
              "verdict": "pro",
              "at": "c-one"
            },
            {
              "text": "Data may be seconds old",
              "verdict": "con",
              "at": "c-err"
            }
          ]
        },
        "right": {
          "title": "Fix 3: add jitter",
          "line": "violet",
          "at": "c-jit",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "TTL = 60s ± random",
              "verdict": "neutral",
              "at": "c-pm"
            },
            {
              "text": "No synchronised expiry",
              "verdict": "pro",
              "at": "c-many"
            },
            {
              "text": "Doesn't protect one hot key",
              "verdict": "con",
              "at": "c-many+1.4"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "recap",
      "choreo": "recap",
      "beats": [
        {
          "say": "Cache-aside: check the cache, fall back to the database."
        },
        {
          "say": "A hot key can expire for everyone at once."
        },
        {
          "say": "So coalesce the misses, serve stale, and add jitter."
        }
      ],
      "scene": {
        "type": "list",
        "title": "The short version",
        "line": "green",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Check the cache, then the database",
            "detail": "Write back with a TTL"
          },
          {
            "text": "Hot keys expire {all at once|red}"
          },
          {
            "text": "Coalesce, serve stale, add jitter",
            "detail": "One query per key, never a stampede"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "outro",
      "choreo": "outro",
      "beats": [
        {
          "say": "So: one hot key, one database query, and no stampede. [pause 0.3]"
        },
        {
          "say": "If this helped, follow for more system design, explained in a few minutes."
        }
      ],
      "scene": {
        "type": "outro",
        "text": "One key. {One query.} No stampede.",
        "handle": "@sainp7",
        "cta": "Follow for more system design",
        "next": "Rate limiting, with a token bucket"
      }
    }
  ]
}
